const giftArtBow="/liushengce-preview/art/gift-box-bow-only.webp";const giftArtAtlas="/liushengce-preview/art/gift-box-sprites.png";
const giftMotionEase=(value)=>value<=0?0:value>=1?1:value*value*(3-2*value);
// 2026-10-17 (evening): the lid is blown off. At launch it leaves straight up with the confetti, reaches the
// top of the screen, tumbles, falls back under gravity and lands next to the box - leaning against a side,
// or lying on the ground in front of it, top up or upside down, left or right - with a small bounce. Which of
// these happens is drawn from a seed at click time, so every opening is different; the seed can be pinned
// (window.__giftLidSeed) for recordings and acceptance. Everything is a pure function of (plan, time).
